OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 31 JAN
OL,4,G1700FThis Classical Life
OL,5,     GJess Gillam swaps tracks with
OL,6,     GJane Mitchell, the principle
OL,7,     Gflute and Creative Director of
OL,8,     GAurora Orchestra, including music
OL,9,     Gby Shostakovich, Tori Amos and
OL,10,     GThomas Ades.
OL,11,G1800FOpera on 3
OL,12,     GRichard Strauss's operatic
OL,13,     Gdepiction of the trials and
OL,14,     Gtribulations of the landed gentry
OL,15,     Gin 19th-century Vienna, as well
OL,16,     Gas one noblewoman's search for
OL,17,     Gauthentic love.
